# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages, for the routes with no prerendered file of
# their own: the detail pages (/admin/students/s0, /tutor/classes/c0) and 404s.
# Static assets are matched first, so every prerendered route still wins here.
#
# 200.html, not index.html. Since the public pages are prerendered, index.html
# now holds the real marketing homepage, and falling back to it would flash the
# homepage before the router swapped in the requested screen. 200.html is the
# empty shell Nuxt emits for exactly this.
/*    /200.html   200
